WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
I am Muhammed.

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.000
How I use AI as a learning partner,

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.100
not just getting answers.

4
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.500
As a developer, when I learn things,

5
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.200
I use AI to understand

6
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.500
and question my understanding to find the mistakes.

7
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Then I build things myself.

8
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.200
I think more students should use AI this way

9
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.500
to improve how they learn,

10
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.000
rather than just completing their work.
